)</span><span><b>03</b>@Lang.T("Final selection confirmed in writing")</span></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="#planner">@Lang.T("Plan a shingle roof") <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-outline" href="/roofing-systems-charlotte-nc">@Lang.T("Compare roof systems") <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="process-section section"><div class="site-shell"><div class="section-heading centered-heading"><p class="eyebrow">@Lang.T("Simple by design")</p><h2>@Lang.T("From first concern to finished roof")</h2></div><div class="process-grid"><article class="process-card"><span>1</span><h3>@Lang.T("Tell us what changed")</h3><p>@Lang.T("A leak, missing shingles, storm damage, an aging roof, or a project that needs a clear budget.")</p></article><article class="process-card"><span>2</span><h3>@Lang.T("See the right path")</h3><p>@Lang.T("Use the planning calculator, request an inspection, or call for an emergency tarp conversation.")</p></article><article class="process-card"><span>3</span><h3>@Lang.T("Confirm in person")</h3><p>@Lang.T("Majestic measures the roof, reviews the scope, and explains what the project actually needs.")</p></article><article class="process-card"><span>4</span><h3>@Lang.T("Build with clarity")</h3><p>@Lang.T("You receive a project plan with the agreed scope, materials, and next steps before work begins.")</p></article></div></div></section><section class="planner-section section" id="planner"><div class="site-shell planner-layout"><div class="planner-intro"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">@Lang.T("Roof replacement planner")</p><h2>@Lang.T("Get a useful price range before you talk to anyone.", "Obtenga un rango útil antes de hablar con nadie.")</h2><p>@Lang.T("Use your home size and roof details to create a planning range. It is not a quote or insurance estimate; an on-site inspection confirms scope, measurements, and final price.")</p><div class="planner-points"><span><i>01</i>@Lang.T("No contact information required to see the range.")</span><span><i>02</i>@Lang.T("Adjusts for stories, roof shape, slope, material, and tear-off.")</span><span><i>03</i>@Lang.T("A field inspection makes it exact.")</span></div></div><div class="calculator-card" data-roof-planner><div class="calculator-header"><span>@Lang.T("Your planning range", "Su rango de planificación")</span><strong data-range>$16,961 <i>—</i> $21,704</strong><small data-area>@Lang.T("Estimated roof area", "Área estimada del techo"): 2,875 sq ft · 28.7 squares</small></div><div class="calculator-fields"><label><span>@Lang.T("Finished home size (sq ft)")</span><input inputMode="numeric" type="text" placeholder="2000" value="2000" data-home-size /><small>@Lang.T("Use the living-area number from your listing or tax record. Do not include the garage unless it is finished living space.")</small></label><label><span>@Lang.T("Stories", "Niveles")</span><select data-stories><option value="1" selected="">@Lang.T("1 story")</option><option value="2">@Lang.T("2 stories")</option><option value="3">@Lang.T("3+ stories")</option></select></label><label><span>@Lang.T("Roof material", "Material del techo")</span><select data-material><option value="architectural" selected="">@Lang.T("Architectural shingles")</option><option value="premium">@Lang.T("Premium shingles")</option><option value="metal">@Lang.T("Metal roofing")</option></select></label><label><span>@Lang.T("Roof shape", "Forma del techo")</span><select data-shape><option value="simple">@Lang.T("Simple / gable")</option><option value="standard" selected="">@Lang.T("Standard / hips & valleys")</option><option value="complex">@Lang.T("Complex / many cutups")</option></select></label><label class="checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" checked data-tearoff /><span>@Lang.T("Include standard existing-roof tear-off")</span></label></div><fieldset class="pitch-picker"><legend>@Lang.T("How steep is your roof? (roof pitch)