"true">+</span></summary><p>@Lang.T("It is a general annual maintenance visit for accessible roof areas. The planned scope includes a visual roof review, maintenance caulking or sealant at exposed fasteners and accessible roof penetrations, chimney water-entry details, and a review for visible roof concerns. It does not include roof replacement, hidden-condition repairs, structural work, decking, major repairs, interior repairs, or items requiring a separate scope.")</p></details><details><summary>@Lang.T("What is the emergency tarp price?")<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>@Lang.T("The published starting emergency tarp service is $125 for one tarp up to 20 × 20 feet, subject to a safe site assessment. A larger standard tarp is $150. Multiple tarps, whole-roof coverage, unusual access, unsafe weather, steep roofs, or additional materials require a separate confirmation before work begins.")</p></details><details><summary>@Lang.T("Can Majestic help with my insurance claim?")<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>@Lang.T("Majestic can inspect visible conditions, document the roofing project, prepare a roofing estimate or scope, and meet at the property with an adjuster when requested. Majestic does not decide coverage, guarantee claim approval, or act as a public adjuster unless separately licensed and authorized.")</p></details><details><summary>@Lang.T("Is the price planner a final quote?")<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>@Lang.T("No. It is an early planning range based on the information you provide. Roof geometry, measurements, materials, access, code requirements, permits, decking, and hidden conditions are confirmed in person.")</p></details><details><summary>@Lang.T("What cities do you serve?")<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>@Lang.T("Majestic serves properties approximately 90 minutes from Charlotte, NC or Rock Hill, SC. Roof and claim-related inspections do not have a travel fee. Availability is confirmed by address, and Raleigh is outside the service area.")</p></details></div></div></section><section class="contact-section section" id="contact"><div class="site-shell contact-layout"><div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">@Lang.T("Start the conversation")</p><h2>@Lang.T("Tell us what is happening above your home.", "Cuéntenos qué está pasando arriba de su casa.")</h2><p>@Lang.T("Choose an option, add your address, and send the request to Majestic. For an active leak or urgent storm damage, call now.")</p><div class="direct-contact"><a href="tel:+19808005991"><small>CALL MAJESTIC</small><strong>(980) 800-5991</strong></a><a href="mailto:ericb.majestic@@gmail.com"><small>EMAIL</small><strong>ericb.majestic@@gmail.com</strong></a></div></div><form class="contact-form" method="post" action="/leads/contact">
@Html.AntiForgeryToken()
<input type="hidden" name="language" value="@(Lang.IsSpanish ? "Español" : "English")" />
<input type="hidden" name="plannerRange" data-planner-range />
<label><span>@Lang.T("Your name")</span><input required="" placeholder="Name" name="name"/></label><div class="form-two"><label><span>@Lang.T("Phone")</span><input required="" type="tel" placeholder="(980) 800-5991" name="phone"/></label><label><span>@Lang.T("Email")</span><input type="email" placeholder="you@@email.com" name="email"/></label></div><label><span>@Lang.T("Property address")</span><input required="" placeholder="Street, city, ZIP" name="address"/></label><div class="form-two"><label><span>@Lang.T("What service do you need?")</span><select name="service"><option value="inspection" selected="">@Lang.T("Roof inspection")</option><option value="replacement">@Lang.T("Roof replacement")</option><option value="repair">@Lang.T("Roof repair")</option><option value="storm">@Lang.T("Storm damage documentation")</option><option value="emergency">@Lang.T("Emergency tarp")</option><option value="tune-up">@Lang.T("$350 Roof Tune-Up")</option><option value="gutter">@Lang.T("Gutters / fascia / soffit")</option><option value="commercial">@Lang.T("Commercial roofing")</option></select></label><label><span>@Lang.T("What happened?")</span><select name="issue"><option value="not-sure" selected="">@Lang.T("Not sure — please inspect")</option><option value="active-leak">@Lang.T("Active roof leak")</option><option value="tree-impact">@Lang.T("Tree / debris hit the roof")</option><option value="chimney-flashing">@Lang.T("Chimney / flashing problem")</option><option value="wind-shingles">@Lang.T("Wind / missing shingles")</option><option value="hail-storm">@Lang.T("Hail / storm concern")</option><option value="open-hole">@Lang.T("Hole / exposed roof area")</option><option value="aging-roof">@Lang.T("Old or worn roof")</option></select></label></div><label><span>@Lang.T("Project details")</span><textarea name="details" rows="4" placeholder="What changed? When did you notice it? Is water entering now?"></textarea></label><button class="button button-gold full-button" type="submit">@Lang.T("Send my request", "Enviar mi solicitud") <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><p class="form-note">@Lang.T("This sandbox stores your request in memory for the /ops board. No email is sent.", "Este sandbox guarda tu solicitud en memoria para el tablero /ops. No se envía correo.")</p></form></div></section>
